# Walks written by hand that `architecture_walks.rs` still allows, until they move onto
# `heki_ir::walk` (docs/development.md, "Analysis cost"). One function per line: its path, the
# codes it is allowed (W1 recursion, W2 worklist, W3 dense fixpoint, W4 linear lookup), and why.
# The list only shrinks: the test fails on an entry that no longer finds anything.

